EXCEPTION: GPLv3-isolierter IEC-61850-Adapter
(M4 Welle 5b, ADR 0035 Decision I-f)

Except for the following sub-paths, which link against the
GPLv3-licensed `pyiec61850-ng` / `libiec61850` library and are
therefore distributed under GPL-3.0-only:

  - `src/grid_gym/adapters/driven/protocol_iec61850/`
  - `tests/unit/adapters/driven/protocol_iec61850/`
  - `tests/integration/test_iec61850_*.py`
  - `tests/integration/fixtures/iec61850/`

These files carry an explicit `SPDX-License-Identifier:
GPL-3.0-only` header. The full GPLv3 text is available in
`LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt`.

The `pyiec61850-ng` library itself is installed via the
optional extra `pip install grid-gym[iec61850]`; the default
`pip install grid-gym` ships only MIT-licensed code and does
not pull GPLv3 dependencies. Users who explicitly install the
IEC-61850 extra accept the GPLv3 distribution terms for the
resulting combined work.
